{"title":"Fulgurite Shard","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">Monster drop: Dune Elemental, Sand Elemental, Glasswrought Colossus</p>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>What it’s for</h2><p>An <b>enchant reagent</b>. Each <b>infuse</b> (one carat more) and each <b>re-enchant</b> to one of these uses one:</p><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li><b>of the Storm</b> <span class=\"muted\">(gems: Onyx + Topaz + Pearl)</span></li><li><b>staff of Lightning</b> <span class=\"muted\">(gems: Amber + Topaz + Topaz)</span></li></ul><p><b>Dropped by</b> <b>Sand Elemental</b>: <a href=\"#/monster/sand-elemental\">Sand Elemental</a>, <a href=\"#/monster/dune-elemental\">Dune Elemental</a>, <a href=\"#/monster/glasswrought-colossus\">Glasswrought Colossus</a>, about 1 kill in 500 (an elite 1 in 50).</p><p class=\"muted\">See <a href=\"#/guide/reforging\">Reforging &amp; reagents</a> for the odds and fees, and <a href=\"#/guide/reagents\">Reagents</a> for every reagent.</p>\n      <h2>How to get it</h2>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <div style=\"margin-top:10px\"><b>Recorded monster drops</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink elite\" data-monster=\"sand-elemental\" title=\"Sand Elemental - dropped it in 10 of 17 looted corpses (1/1.7)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/7fd45a0197a0daf36551.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Sand Elemental</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1.7<br>×1–2</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"glasswrought-colossus\" title=\"Glasswrought Colossus - dropped it in 4 of 8 looted corpses (1/2)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/5937c516cba955676068.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Glasswrought Colossus</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/2<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink elite\" data-monster=\"dune-elemental\" title=\"Dune Elemental - dropped it in 23 of 50 looted corpses (1/2)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/77761b474a7384a1df3e.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Dune Elemental</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/2<br>×1–6</span></div></div><div class=\"s muted\" style=\"margin-top:6px\">Drop rate as 1/X (about 1 kill in X drops it, counted over the corpses of each monster whose loot was recorded), and ×N, how many come in one drop.</div></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"item\" data-map-id=\"fulgurite-shard\">Show where to get it on the map</button>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic \"><img src=\"data/img/bd84404c123fb8e4bf22.svg\" alt=\"Fulgurite Shard\"></div><h3>Fulgurite Shard</h3><table>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <tr><th>Dropped by</th><td>3 monsters</td></tr>\n      \n      \n      <tr><th>Last seen</th><td>10/17/2026, 7:27:01 PM</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}